Subject: [BioC] More than one package document with the same name
Message-ID: <20140805162517.CD84F61007@nutria.fhcrc.org>

Hi,

A suggestion. Typically a Bioconductor package provides documentation of two types, one or more vignettes and a reference manual; and they have the same file name, PackageName.pdf.  When downloaded some file name manipulation is required, or accept PackageName(1).pdf.

I suggest the documents be given different names, for example the reference manual could be named PackageNameRefMan.pdf. Package checking could enforce the rule.


