On Thursday, August 14, 2014 2:29 PM, Michael Love <michaelisaiahlove at gmail.com> wrote:



hi Tao,

If you want to generate the log fold change of the two groups you are focusing on (dose 10 and 0 for group 8), this is not just the interaction term, but the main effect (dose 10 vs 0) plus the interaction term (time8.dose10 vs time8.dose0). ?See the last example in ?results for an example of this ("the condition effect for group Z").

You should use the list() argument to contrast, something like:

results(dds, contrast=list(c("dose10","time8.dose10"), c("dose0","time8.dose0")))

Given the parameters, it looks like this would be:

> (-.48 - .88) + 1.26
[1] -0.1

Mike



