You should use the default Wald test for such a comparison, not the LRT.
See the vignette for an explanation of the difference between the two tests.

So simply use DESeq() and then use:

results(dds, contrast = c("condition", "B", "A"))

> Should I take "res.1" or "res.2", or both are wrong? and what is the
correct way to do it?
