Dear Rossella,

Your plateConf looks pretty good. You can make it a bit more concise with the following:

*	^[A-H]0[1-3]	RF_NoTGFB
*	^[A-H]0[4-8]	RF_TGFB
*	^A[C-F]0[1-3]	UBB_NoTGFB
*	^A[C-F]0[4-8]	UBB_TGFB

The ^ is important to avoid any confused matches between e.g. A and AA.

Best wishes,
Joseph

