> actually had not considered this would be problem because (correct me if I
> am wrong) I thought that the number of reads for a peak was an indicator of
> the degree of methylation, much like the quantitation of methylation given
> by beta or M values for arrays. So, my question is why would one want to
> remove such stacked reads?
